  9   4010              ; A green hill under a white sky, its edge a line up for every two pixels across.
 10   4010              ; Left of x = 128 each strip is one colour, the paper; right of it each strip on
 11   4010              ; the edge has the hill in its ink and the sky in its paper.
 12   4010 F3           init:   di
 13   4011 31 80 F3             ld sp, SYS_AREA
